 "titulo": "Why manhole covers are round ⭕ #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "WHY ROUND?",
 "descripcion": "A square lid can fall through its own hole. A circle can't, no matter how you turn it. Here's the trick hiding under every street.\n\n#engineering #manhole #city #howitworks #shorts",
 "tags": [
